# set up two connections for use in the RFC 2180 tests.
depends append
protocol imap watcher
receive 1
* OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 AUTH=ANONYMOUS AUTH=CRAM-MD5 AUTH=DIGEST-MD5 AUTH=PLAIN AUTH=LOGIN COMPRESS=DEFLATE ENABLE ID LITERAL+ SASL-IR STARTTLS] imapscript.test.oryx.com Archiveopteryx IMAP Server (security checking disabled)
send 2
a login script script
b select inbox
receive 9
a OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 ACL BINARY CATENATE CHILDREN COMPRESS=DEFLATE CONDSTORE ENABLE ESEARCH I18NLEVEL=1 ID IDLE LIST-EXTENDED LITERAL+ MOVE MULTIAPPEND NAMESPACE OBJECTID QUOTA RIGHTS=ekntx SPECIAL-USE STARTTLS THREAD=ORDEREDSUBJECT THREAD=REFS THREAD=REFERENCES UIDONLY UIDPLUS UNSELECT URLAUTH UTF8=ACCEPT WITHIN] done
* 4 EXISTS
* 0 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 5] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
b OK [READ-WRITE] done
use main
end
